# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build for the API image.
#
# Without this file gcloud falls back to .gitignore-derived rules, and
# .dockerignore only filters what reaches the IMAGE, not what is uploaded: the
# source tarball is stored in the project's `<project>_cloudbuild` bucket. So
# this list is what keeps .env.development — which holds the Gemini key — out
# of that bucket. Keep `.env*` here.
.gcloudignore
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
outputs/
logs/
test/
web/
*.log
*-service-account*.json
